ind":"update","title":"Demo Patch 1.0.0.1337","summary":"Greetings, Gladiators!Just in time for steam next fest, here is another minor demo patch.As always, entries marked with ⚔️ have been reported by you, our glorious community.Fixes- ⚔️ Fixed movement being possible while loading screen was still up- (Online) Fixed spike and lava pits instantly killing clients- Fixed Triple Arrow upgrade increasing DMG instead of reducing it- Fixed Shield Laser being blocked by too many objectsChanges- ⚔️ Dash cannot be used during Shield Ram anymore- ⚔️ Added cust","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:12:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690722","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4962610-1846018067943274","game_id":"steam-4962610","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch 1.0.0.1316","summary":"Greetings, Gladiators!We finally managed to fix some of the most annoying bugs so far.As always, entries marked with ⚔️ have been reported by you, our glorious community.Fixes- ⚔️ Fixed bug that led to players flying off the map when ragdolling with specific helmets equipped- ⚔️ (Online) Fixed menus getting stuck in Waiting for opponent state if one player was in pause menu while the other player got ready- Fixed shadows popping in and out of existence on medium shadow qualityIf you find any bug","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T08:05:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067943274","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4962610-1846018067940655","game_id":"steam-4962610","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch 1.0.0.1310","summary":"Greetings, Gladiators!Here is another small demo patch with some more fixes and changes.Entries marked with ⚔️ have been reported by you, our glorious community.Fixes- ⚔️ (Online) Fixed opponent being able to select your own upgrade if they entered pause menu and came back- (Online) Fixed client throwing weapons not spawning a projectile and weapon pickup with high ping- Fixed projectiles colliding with pit traps- Fixed explosive arrows not damaging props- Hooligans are now interrupted by freezi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T11:23:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067940655","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4962610-1846018067929774","game_id":"steam-4962610","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch 1.0.0.1297.166","summary":"Greetings, gladiators!Here is a small demo patch with some more major and minor fixes.Entries marked with ⚔️ have been reported by our glorious community.Fixes(Online) Fixed homing arrows not working at all for non-hosting players(Online) Improved sword hit detection for non-hosting players(Online) Spawning traps by dashing and spikes from blocking now happens instantly for non-hosting players(Online) Fixed jittery movement with higher ping⚔️ Fixed bug reporter breaking input when leaving it ing","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T13:53:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929774","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4962610-1845383656393637","game_id":"steam-4962610","kind":"announcement","title":"Crowd Favorites DEMO is OUT NOW!","summary":"Hey Gladiators! The day has come.We're incredibly excited to share that the first-ever demo of Crowd Favorites is now live!We welcome you to try out the demo and enjoy some friendly brawling!Leave us some feedback so we can improve the game.What can you do in the demo?Battle across a variety of arenas filled with hazardsStack unique upgrades and try to find broken buildsCustomize your Gladiator with various hatsChallenge your friends on the couch or fight onlineWe are also happy to announce that","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T14:39:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656393637","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4962610-1842846814443381","game_id":"steam-4962610","kind":"announcement","title":"Play the Playtest now!","summary":"Hey Gladiators! We just started our first Playtest.Grab your access, invite someone or play local with a friend and head into the arena.We are looking forward to your feedback.You can report bugs and send us your feedback via the ingame button with a bug icon.You are also welcome to join our discord, you can find it here: https://discord.gg/vvp2FBUN2m","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T13:54:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814443381","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4962610-1841579228678329","game_id":"steam-4962610","kind":"announcement","title":"Sign up for Steam Playtest!","summary":"Hey gladiators! We are currently preparing to launch a Steam Playtest and just enabled the access request on the steam page. If you are interested in getting an early glimpse of the game, report bugs and give feedback, we would love for you to sign up! Of course, since this is a 1v1 game, you will also be able to invite a friend of yours should you get selected to participate. Just head over to the steam page and click the Request Access button under the screenshots section. See you in the arena","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T13:29:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228678329","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4962610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:52:10Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:52:10Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4962610":"2026-10-26T05:52:10Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4962610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:52:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:52:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5240830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:52:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:52:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4962610","app_id":4962610,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:11Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"22f0fb32cf8fde2b7bf3bd6a8e168b69fb3b904deb1c3078a7eb660bc68c620b","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Step into the arena for fame and glory in Crowd Favorites, a 1v1 PvP rogue-lite fighter. Lost a round? You get to draft crazy upgrades and  stack them for chaotic synergies to outsmart your opponent in fast-paced, unpredictable duels!","publishers":[{"name":"VoodooDuck"}],"developers":[{"name":"VoodooDuck"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1793368800,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Crowd Favorites Release Date","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1790865022","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4962